#: price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Set role-based product prices in WooCommerce. Apply global multipliers or "
"fixed per-product prices per role. Upgrade to Pro for rules, quantity "
"discounts, adjustment types, and more."
msgstr ""
"Angi rollebaserte produktpriser i WooCommerce. Bruk generelle "
"multiplikatorer eller faste priser per produkt for hver rolle. Oppgrader "
"til Pro for å få tilgang til regler, mengderabatter, justeringstyper og mer."

